        "verse": 14
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 17,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "The uncircumcised male who is not circumcised in the flesh of his foreskin, that soul shall be cut off from his people. He has broken my covenant.”",
      "ko": "할례를 받지 아니한 남자 곧 그 양피를 베지 아니한 자는 백성 중에서 끊어지리니 그가 내 언약을 배반하였음이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "8f97fa3d403938fa7db3e5512ee8be7e5e348cbaf2fdf4961b48693f0e3cad27",
      "translation_text_hash": "11dc31cf8c188bf3609135bd0069ddaea2183028efc8105a61f02070384bfba2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
